# --- build output ---
/bin/
*.exe
*.test
*.out
coverage/

# --- generated frontend bundle ---
# internal/webui/dist is COMMITTED on purpose. The package uses
# `//go:embed all:dist`, which fails to compile when the directory is missing,
# so a Go-only checkout would break `go build ./...` and `go test ./...`.
# `npm run build` regenerates these files; the Docker build ignores the
# committed copy entirely and rebuilds the console from web/ sources.
/web/node_modules/
/web/dist/
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# --- editors and OS noise ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- local overrides ---
.env
.env.*
docker-compose.override.yml
